  (descr "Compatible with Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.3=13.95mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: ISO Enter flipped upside down (courtyard only; switch orientation unchanged). No stabilizer PCB features.")
